Vendored from AnkiQuest's own fork
==================================

1. FlashCardsContract.java
   Source: https://github.com/AnkiQuest/AnkiQuest-Android/blob/master/api/src/main/java/com/ichi2/anki/FlashCardsContract.kt
   Fork commit: bd339154fb535bfd386f0811711f9fae07c8de0a (2026-11-18)
   Licence: offered as-is, copying and distribution with or without modification permitted
   in any medium without royalty (the file's own notice, retained in the header).
   Location in this project: app/src/main/java/org/ankiquest/ankiconnectandroid/ankidroid_api/FlashCardsContract.java
   Only the column-name and segment constants are kept; the names are the wire contract
   with the flashcards content provider of AnkiDroid and AnkiQuest. This replaces the
   former `com.github.ankidroid:Anki-Android:2.17alpha14` JitPack artifact, which was
   upstream's build rather than ours.
